  0x10000 <= sec -> sec + 1024 < 0x698000 -> 0x10000 <= nm < 2 ^ 47 -> 0x10000 <= F -> F + 512 < 0x698000 -> 0 <= fb < 256 -> Z.land fb 1 = 0 ->
